@startuml
title Saga (choreography) — резерв не выполнен

participant Mobile
participant API
participant OrderService
participant Kafka
participant InventoryService as Inventory
participant NotificationService as Notification

== Сценарий B: резерв не выполнен ==
Mobile -> API : Checkout(payload)
API -> OrderService : CreateOrder(payload)
OrderService -> Kafka : OrderCreated

Kafka -> Inventory : OrderCreated
Inventory -> Inventory : check stock & try reserve
Inventory -> Kafka : InventoryReservationFailed { order_id, reason }

Kafka -> OrderService : InventoryReservationFailed
OrderService -> Kafka : OrderCancelled { order_id, reason: "OutOfStock" }

Kafka -> Notification : OrderCancelled
Notification -> Kafka : NotificationSent { order_id, channel }

note right: Клиент увидит ошибку и статус "Отменён".

@enduml
